Complete Flutter + Android Development Setup Guide for a New Windows Laptop
This document provides a single, complete, future-proof setup guide for configuring a brand-new Windows laptop for Flutter + Android development. It includes installation steps, environment variables, PATH configuration, license acceptance, and verification commands.

1. Install Required Software
Git
Download and install Git for Windows: https://git-scm.com/download/win
Python
Download Python 3.10+ and select Add Python to PATH: https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/
Flutter SDK
Download Flutter SDK (Windows ZIP): https://docs.flutter.dev/get-started/install/windows
Extract the ZIP to:
C:\flutter

Android Studio
Download and install Android Studio: https://developer.android.com/studio

2. Install Android SDK Components
Open Android Studio → More Actions → SDK Manager
SDK Platforms
Select:
Android 14 (or latest)
Android 13
SDK Tools
Enable:
Android SDK Command-line Tools (latest)
Android SDK Build-tools
Android SDK Platform-tools
Android Emulator
Google USB Driver
Click Apply → OK.

3. Configure Environment Variables (Admin CMD)
Open Command Prompt as Administrator:
Win + R → cmd → Ctrl + Shift + Enter

Android SDK Paths
setx ANDROID_HOME "C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Android\sdk" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Android\sdk\platform-tools" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Android\sdk\cmdline-tools\latest\bin" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Android\sdk\tools\bin" /M

Flutter Paths
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\flutter\bin" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\flutter\bin\dart" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\flutter\bin\cache\dart-sdk\bin" /M

Git Paths
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Program Files\Git\bin" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Program Files\Git\cmd" /M

Python Paths
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python310\" /M
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Users\Home\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python310\Scripts\" /M

PowerShell Path (Required for Flutter)
setx PATH "%PATH%;C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\" /M


4. Restart System
Restart:
CMD
PowerShell
VS Code
Android Studio
Windows (recommended)

5. Verify All Tools
Git
git --version

Flutter
flutter doctor

ADB
adb version

Python
python --version
pip --version

PowerShell
where powershell


6. Accept Android Licenses
Run:
flutter doctor --android-licenses

Press Y for all licenses.

7. Final Verification
Run:
flutter doctor

You should see:
• No issues found!

This confirms your laptop is fully ready for Flutter + Android development.

8. Optional: Recommended Tools
Visual Studio Code
Flutter & Dart extensions
Android Emulator setup

9. Summary
This document provides a complete one-time setup for:
Flutter SDK
Android SDK
Command-line tools
Git
Python
PowerShell
Environment variables
License acceptance
Once completed, your system is fully configured for Android development.

End of document.
